### 給 IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client 用（Windows 不想用 bash 時）
### 每個舊系統只接受「發給自己的 token」（aud），所以要從對應的前端 client 取 token

### 1. alice 從工單系統前端登入
POST http://localhost:8080/realms/demo/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=ticket-web&username=alice&password=alice

> {% client.global.set("aliceTicket", response.body.access_token); %}

### 2. alice 從物流系統前端登入
POST http://localhost:8080/realms/demo/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=logistics-web&username=alice&password=alice

> {% client.global.set("aliceLogi", response.body.access_token); %}

### 3. 物流人員 wang 從物流系統前端登入
POST http://localhost:8080/realms/demo/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=logistics-web&username=wang&password=wang

> {% client.global.set("wangLogi", response.body.access_token); %}

### 4. alice 的工單（只會看到 T-1001、T-1003）
GET http://localhost:8083/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceTicket}}

### 5. 越權：bob 的工單 → 403
GET http://localhost:8083/api/tickets/T-1002
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceTicket}}

### 6. 拿工單系統的 token 打物流系統 → 401（aud 不符）
GET http://localhost:8082/api/shipments/S-3001
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceTicket}}

### 7. 建立改寄申請（待物流人員執行，地址還不會變）
POST http://localhost:8082/api/redirect-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceLogi}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "shipmentId": "S-3001", "newAddress": "台北市信義區松仁路 100 號 12 樓", "reason": "客人下週出差，改寄公司" }

> {% client.global.set("rrId", response.body.id); %}

### 8. 物流人員執行改寄
POST http://localhost:8082/api/redirect-requests/{{rrId}}/execute
Authorization: Bearer {{wangLogi}}

### 9. 補償 150 元（超過 alice 上限 → 202 待主管簽核）
POST http://localhost:8083/api/tickets/T-1001/compensations
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceTicket}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "COUPON", "amount": 150, "reason": "客人很生氣", "channel": "AI_COPILOT" }

### 10. Token exchange：alice 從 Copilot 登入，再由 Agent 換成物流 Adapter 的 token
POST http://localhost:8080/realms/demo/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=copilot-web&username=alice&password=alice

> {% client.global.set("aliceCopilot", response.body.access_token); %}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/realms/demo/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=urn:ietf:params:oauth:grant-type:token-exchange&client_id=copilot-agent&client_secret=copilot-agent-secret&subject_token={{aliceCopilot}}&subject_token_type=urn:ietf:params:oauth:token-type:access_token&requested_token_type=urn:ietf:params:oauth:token-type:access_token&audience=mcp-adapter-logistics
